{"title":"2006 Romanian NMO Problems/Grade 8/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Romanian_NMO_Problems/Grade_8/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be a positive integer. Prove that there exists an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/a/58a0ef476cf5452cdb5a980c9697dc1068e0731b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, and numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/c/82cf16b989943aa4203f6e3dbd492144606d4f48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i \\in \\{ -1, 1 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, such that </p><center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3f8748bf68501f3212d2a2fabd83d374f793ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\sum_{1\\leq i &lt; j \\leq k } a_ia_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"124\" height=\"40\" />.</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Romanian_NMO_Problems/Grade_8/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that there exists such an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/c/82cf16b989943aa4203f6e3dbd492144606d4f48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i \\in \\{ -1, 1 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/1522c3a291c074cb5e80dd39b35044dc7a304e2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\in \\{1,\\ldots,k\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3f8748bf68501f3212d2a2fabd83d374f793ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\sum_{1\\leq i &lt; j \\leq k } a_ia_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"124\" height=\"40\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/f/41fabd5458adb04dda8267d72e4c99764793b4d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}X &amp;= \\#\\{i\\in [k] \\;:\\; a_{i}=-1\\} \\\\ Y &amp;= \\#\\{i\\in [k] \\;:\\; a_{i}=1\\}\\end{align*}\" width=\"209\" height=\"44\" />\nthen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b895feea5d3d3e0c6b1b72a11df460532cb92490.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n=\\sum_{1\\leq i &lt; j \\leq k } a_ia_j = \\binom{X}{2}+\\binom{Y}{2}-XY = \\frac{(X-Y)^{2}-(X+Y)}{2}.\\]\" width=\"492\" height=\"55\" /> We see that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This motivates the following construction: Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be large enough such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/9376c90de4112d16c8056b768f30e16be436d484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{m}{2} &gt; n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"79\" height=\"53\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f1289fff8a359e4718bd97402bb6efc09eab790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y = \\binom{m}{2} - n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"115\" height=\"53\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/d/28d2c2b25f1cebaec497d396b9a774e55cf8ce68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = Y+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/c/6ec4484bc7ce5c5b67ad6e874660d527681faed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = X+Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d5b17f3294101bd6fa62b980e82890c6a8f794.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1},\\ldots,a_{X} = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee7d851a30f778d41bc40a43d9ae7049bfa66760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{X+1},\\ldots,a_{X+Y} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c7a53a087dcfc52c2ed7b72893ace674d3a9e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\sum_{1\\leq i &lt; j \\leq k } a_ia_j &amp;= \\binom{X}{2}+\\binom{Y}{2}-XY\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{(X-Y)^{2}-(X+Y)}{2} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{m^{2}-\\left(m+\\binom{m}{2} - n+\\binom{m}{2} - n\\right)}{2} \\\\ &amp;= n.\\end{align*}\" width=\"361\" height=\"170\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Romanian_NMO_Problems/Grade_8/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Romanian_NMO_Problems\" title=\"2006 Romanian NMO Problems\">2006 Romanian NMO Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018052630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 128/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4705/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3594:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018052630 and revision id 39256. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}